{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"inazuma_tri_commission","name_zh":"三奉行","name_en":"Tri-Commission","aliases":["三奉行","Tri-Commission"],"category":"institution","scope":"regional","regions":["Inazuma"],"summary":"三奉行是稻妻幕府体系内对社奉行、天领奉行和勘定奉行的合称，三者分别由神里家、九条家和柊家领导，分掌文化礼仪、军事治安及财政边境等事务，并共同商议政务。九条孝行与柊慎介事发后，天领奉行和勘定奉行分别进入九条镰治、柊千里代理家主并临时主持相关事务的阶段；社奉行仍由神里绫人主持。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_01","text":"三奉行是社奉行、天领奉行和勘定奉行三个组织的合称，负责处理稻妻各方面事务。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期制度设置","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_02","text":"社奉行由神里家领导，天领奉行由九条家领导，勘定奉行由柊家领导。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现有制度设置","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_03","text":"三奉行会在Tenshukaku共同商议政务。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"常态政务运作","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_04","text":"天领奉行负责军事与治安事务，并曾负责执行眼狩令及锁国令下对非法出入境行为的管制。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"包括眼狩令与锁国令施行时期","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_05","text":"勘定奉行负责稻妻的财政、关务、边境以及商贸和行政事务，并在锁国令时期审查合法出入境者。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期职责；出入境管制描述包括锁国令时期","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_03","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_06","text":"社奉行是稻妻的文化代表，负责祭祀礼仪、庆典、公共节庆以及神社和寺庙相关事务。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期职责","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_07","text":"神里绫华曾表示，社奉行提出废止眼狩令时，提案总会迅速遭天领奉行与勘定奉行否决。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"眼狩令施行时期","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_08","text":"九条孝行曾任天领奉行奉行官，后因与愚人众勾结之事败露而被软禁；柊慎介曾任勘定奉行奉行官，后因参与愚人众的谋划而被捕入狱。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"Omnipresence Over Mortals事件后","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_03","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_09","text":"九条镰治现阶段是九条家的家主代行，并在尚未确定正式继任者时临时主持天领奉行；柊千里在父亲被捕后成为柊家代理家主，并被列为勘定奉行的代理负责人。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"两名前任负责人失势后的代理阶段","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_03","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_07","local_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_10","text":"神里绫人是神里家家主兼社奉行奉行官。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现阶段","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_06","bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_11","text":"Ei称天领奉行奉行官由她任命；若要改由新的家族担任该职，须先进行新的决斗。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"天领奉行继任争议期间","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_05"]},{"fact_id":"tri_commission_fact_12","text":"鹰司家事件后，九条镰治表示天领奉行内部已逐渐稳定，但他仍在适应家主代行的职责。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"鹰司家事件后","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_06","local_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"领导层危机前","order_hint":10,"events":["天领奉行、勘定奉行和社奉行分别由九条家、柊家和神里家领导；九条孝行与柊慎介分别担任前两奉行的奉行官。"],"current_status":"该阶段的天领奉行与勘定奉行领导状态已经结束。","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_03"]},{"period":"Omnipresence Over Mortals事件后","order_hint":20,"events":["九条孝行与愚人众勾结之事败露，天领奉行陷入混乱，九条镰治临时填补领导空缺。","柊慎介因参与愚人众的谋划被捕，柊千里成为柊家代理家主。"],"current_status":"天领奉行与勘定奉行均进入代理领导阶段。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_03"]},{"period":"其后的天领奉行继任争议","order_hint":30,"events":["鹰司家试图争取天领奉行奉行官之位。","九条镰治接受Ei的决斗并展现意志；Ei随后暂缓对九条家的惩罚，命鹰司家继续辅佐九条家，但明确表示九条家过去的错误不会被抹除。"],"current_status":"九条家获得一段宽限期，九条镰治继续临时主持天领奉行，正式继任问题仍未最终解决。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_05"]},{"period":"鹰司家事件后","order_hint":40,"events":["九条镰治以家主代行身份整顿天领奉行，其内部逐渐恢复稳定。","九条镰治和柊千里仍分别被称为天领奉行与勘定奉行所属家族的代理家主。"],"current_status":"天领奉行趋于稳定，但两奉行代理领导者是否及何时转为正式奉行官，现有证据没有说明。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_06","fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_07","local_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"稻妻民众一般可知三奉行是幕府治理体系的重要组成部分，并可从其日常职能和公开公告得知三家及代理家主的基本情况；内部继任争议、政务表决过程和任命依据的细节则未必公开。","likely_known_by":["稻妻一般民众","稻妻幕府官员","三奉行所属人员","经常办理商贸、治安、出入境或礼仪事务者"],"unlikely_known_by":["未接触稻妻政务的外国普通民众","不了解幕府内部事务者","一般民众对于继任谈判、决斗及内部权力争议的完整细节"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":[]},"activation_keys":["三奉行","Tri-Commission"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["任务步骤、试用角色配置、等级、命座、武器、天赋、圣遗物与战斗属性","版本实装及页面更新记录","摆设收集与其他仅用于游戏内容索引的信息"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["Fandom根据社奉行提案遭否决而推断存在特定形式的正式委员会，以及社奉行不能直接向雷电将军呈递提案；该制度细节未作为confirmed事实收录。","三奉行与现实历史机构的对应和类比属于考据或编辑者分析，未作为提瓦特世界内事实收录。","现有证据不足以把“家主代行”“代理家主”和“奉行官”认定为法理上完全相同的职位。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_inazuma_tri_commission","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Tri-Commission","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tri-Commission","language":"en","revision_id":"2113119","source_text_sha256":"df03e81b4799059cbe0e9eaa66404f165eeab907896e4e56420812dfcc365f45"},{"source_id":"bwiki_inazuma_tri_commission","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"三奉行","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E4%B8%89%E5%A5%89%E8%A1%8C","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"612611","source_text_sha256":"4f90f12f5a4dbf638dd7341680234d904b29a7d6d45bef6f791f16027efe0b98"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Tri-Commission","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tri-Commission","language":"en","revision_id":"2113119","source_text_sha256":"51c312dca671ef442214db61286e4b71db274a58ed980b2f76eaa1e5edd088fb"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Tenryou Commission","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tenryou_Commission","language":"en","revision_id":"1858407","source_text_sha256":"4374179d495e333307cc340dd6f6e199a209233211a62de2f486083684293aa4"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Kanjou Commission","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kanjou_Commission","language":"en","revision_id":"1677380","source_text_sha256":"bfe95a1197502cd2e5ff193d6b3eb217744bd45a2b925d2fecaf3d9a79c4d436"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"To Hear Mortal Hearts","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/To_Hear_Mortal_Hearts","language":"en","revision_id":"1879503","source_text_sha256":"9c06d452777ec79b09b6bb538dbc0631fffdf6c46f097ea937d43151cb8d06a8"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_06","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"New Shoots from Old Branches","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/New_Shoots_from_Old_Branches","language":"en","revision_id":"2106331","source_text_sha256":"32ec5ee712985f0237a3d6353f1a1961b4803b8b3b2f9061e16b5fbffa33fef5"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_07","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"The Truth Is Also a Lie","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/The_Truth_Is_Also_a_Lie","language":"en","revision_id":"2029376","source_text_sha256":"fa7b02d8d69eb9f0768d4f8436919cb17c89b564219174dd7b37ab6b5ff66d90"},{"source_id":"local_sup_inazuma_tri_commission_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"旧枝新芽","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_12033.json#unit=1203307","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"6258d79d64fdbc8ae3a50edd92a81c9e81d323c0117a93c6e57bb1c9cacc0e5b"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"6452a3636aa9cf6b6e7fc6466ceb5426655c7ef073e2fa78290ec1ac20a9f188","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["英文Fandom使用Commissioner、acting/proxy和Proxy Clan Head等称谓，中文直接文本则明确称九条镰治为“家主代行”；现有证据不能确定这些头衔在制度上是否完全等同。","社奉行提案需要经过何种正式机构、表决规则为何，以及能否直接上呈雷电将军，仍缺少直接制度文本。"],"missing_evidence":["领导层更替、天领奉行继任争议及其后稳定化事件均缺少世界内历法日期，只能按剧情先后排列。","尚无明确证据说明九条镰治或柊千里是否、何时会由代理家主正式转任奉行官，也没有说明代理阶段何时结束。"],"needs_human_review":true}}